Rule 1 (input and other tensors must have compatible shapes for broadcasting)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1)) ∨ (ndim(v_1) < ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) + i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) + i) = 1)) ∨ (ndim(v_2) < ndim(v_1) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : (shape(v_2, i) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2) + i) ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2) + i) = 1))
